Bind Npc 31564 Zone 11 for karus
Bind Npc 31563 Zone 12 for elmorad
Quest 662 "Contract Delivery"
    Journal for karus "You must accept the request of [Trader] Drill."
    Journal for elmorad "You must accept the request of [Trader] Ellon."
    Collect 1 of 900168000

Requires player level >= 67 and quest 661 is completed

Rewards
    Give 250000 experience
    Give 10000 coins

On available
    Say "So the trading was successful! Return to [Merchant] Drill."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Hmm. Oh, you're back! How did it go?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Oh! Is it true? Very pleased? Hahaha! Thanks to you,we can now do our business well here.\n\nEslant updated traders passed to the Transaction Agreement, the drill must inform the success of the agreement."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Hmm. Oh, you're back! How did it go?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Oh! Is it true? Very pleased? Hahaha! Thanks to you,we can now do our business well here.\n\nEslant updated traders Ellen passed to the Transaction Agreement, you must inform the success of the agreement."

On in_progress
    Say "However, where is the [Trade Contract]? Have you forgotten it?"

On claimable
    Show quest "Oh, it is indeed the [Trade Contract]. I have confirmed it.\n\nYou have done very well. I will see you again with another opportunity!"
